{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_19182cd407bcef9682c95b578e5e73ebbaecf6ea5fce6ed5d43ec4ba19d9682b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"zai-org/glm-5@008de4dbcc22 snapshot 2d38f9b696eeac7f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7fe7e6da8a3a7b7e9a32493549b0a33e358c9a0ca625a512ed121c24e83fb5c5"],"source_ids":["src_f04119a0333a56eba145d8a1fd343519"],"text":"GLM-5.3-Flash uses a newly trained base model with a hybrid sparse-plus-linear attention architecture and Manifold-Constrained Hyper-Connections (mHC), trained on a 30T-token multimodal corpus.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2b05b74e615f29dcd643d9df8a1fa4a0da0600d873fa8f4aeb63b4f2b38faaff","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"zai-org/glm-5@008de4dbcc22 snapshot 2d38f9b696eeac7f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_65b3cec8389bcf3b81f8406b7a748fbbd16a7c739b32cc8add3bb5d03e01dce4"],"source_ids":["src_f04119a0333a56eba145d8a1fd343519"],"text":"Fine-tuning is supported via Slime (v0.3.0+), the GLM team's RL framework, and ms-swift (v4.4.0+) supporting SFT, PPO, and GRPO.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3f0181d94c292def495457ced165dce23bef3f86f86fe8261bc19b22ac2afbe8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"zai-org/glm-5@008de4dbcc22 snapshot 2d38f9b696eeac7f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_10447a4f4d0c6fa808fe74f80fa90f8a5dc6870369d196d35110b2d8368b4448","slc_c2266ea500f5bc1ab07c7258c95f5531e119e14d2dad154c7c820686d1e05422"],"source_ids":["src_f04119a0333a56eba145d8a1fd343519"],"text":"Inference is documented for SGLang, vLLM, TokenSpeed, Transformers, KTransformers, and Unsloth, with Ascend NPU deployment via vLLM-Ascend, xLLM, and SGLang.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_68e9c18d840cbe2ae2ec4bdd665510bf5e9c75ba93dd4c8547dee11988d2f1c1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"zai-org/glm-5@008de4dbcc22 snapshot 2d38f9b696eeac7f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_27e444aafc0392fb82a8edf4ce5ec7322b51a7a48ca0c45afc4010369e9e1545"],"source_ids":["src_f04119a0333a56eba145d8a1fd343519"],"text":"GLM-5 scales from GLM-4.5's 355B parameters (32B active) to 744B parameters (40B active), with pre-training data increased from 23T to 28.5T tokens.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6a17be0bab0b2728b34e79532ea3aa27ece77e1500cb1b4cd5d6dcf7305239ac","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"zai-org/glm-5@008de4dbcc22 snapshot 2d38f9b696eeac7f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4b4c497f7522a83757473665dee7f6558e3a9a96398dea422e1beb47ecb420db"],"source_ids":["src_f04119a0333a56eba145d8a1fd343519"],"text":"Downloadable checkpoints include GLM-5.3 and GLM-5.3-BF16 at 744B-A40B, and GLM-5.3-Flash and its BF16 variant at 320B-A18B, hosted on Hugging Face and ModelScope.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:33:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_345b3e2327f34a5db0591e4818fc1087"}
